    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt feel like growth though. it just feels like i'm wasting resources. every meal i eat, every breath i take, it feels like i'm just consuming things that should have gone to them. how am i supposed to \"focus on healing\" when the very fact that i survived feels like a cosmic mistake? it feels like the only way to actually balance the scales would be to stop taking up this space.",
